&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:1pt;min-height:1pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:16pt;"&gt;白井　美由里&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:16pt;"&gt;3千株所有&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:16pt;"&gt;―&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:45pt;line-height:14pt;"&gt;なお、武井敏一氏、星長清隆氏及び白井美由里氏と当社との間で人的関係はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:11pt;font-size:11pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:22.5pt;"&gt;（社外監査役と提出会社との関係）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="text-align:left;margin-left:50pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="align_left" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:280.8pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
