  <jpcrp_cor:RemunerationEtcPaidByGroupToEachDirectorOrOtherOfficerTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;⑤  役員ごとの連結報酬等の総額等（１億円以上である者に限る）&lt;/p&gt;
